==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]]

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Mohawk Cat (Enemy)|Li'l Mohawk Cat]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*7 [[Li'l Island Cat (Enemy)|Li'l Island Cats]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l King Dragon Cat (Enemy)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Don't let the 11★ be a threat as with high enough [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Eraser]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]] with some combos such as [[Biohazard (Combo)|Bio]] [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bone]] and bringing [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando Jr.]] will help a lot with keeping them back, keep in mind Li'l King Dragon Cat outranges Jagando's base range. Another great unit is [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] as Mina is an excellent pick for chipping down Li'l King Dragon.

Other units you could bring for support is [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]] although use with caution so Jagando doesn't get too close to Li'l King Dragon Cat. If your meatshields aren't holding as well as you wanted them you could take [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster]] with you for some support.

